# Personal (non-plugin) subagents live here. Unlike the other owned dirs,
# agents/ is NOT whole-dir symlinked (the thermos plugin surfaces agents into
# the same ~/.config/claude/agents namespace, which conflicts with a whole-dir
# symlink). So each agent needs a one-line per-item entry in ../default.nix —
# copy the thermos agent lines as a template. Claude ignores this .gitkeep.
